      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473519\">H 14838</a> – Muhammad Bin Ahmad Bin Al-Salt, from Abdullah Bin Al-Salt, from yunus, from Al-Mufazzal Bin Salih, from Muhammad Al-Halby, who has said:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-i\">I</span> asked Abu Abdullah</span><sup>asws</sup> about the Statement of Allah<sup>azwj</sup>: <span class=\"ibTxt\">“<a href=\"/#/books/quran:57#h17\"><a href=\"/books/quran:57#h17\">[57:17]</a></a> Know that Allah gives life to the earth after its death”</span>. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘The justice, after the oppression’. "
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "391. Muhammad Bin Ahmad Bin Al-Salt, from Abdullah Bin Al-Salt, from yunus, from Al-Mufazzal Bin Salih, from Muhammad Al-Halby, who has said: I asked Abu Abdullah (a.s.) about the Statement of Allah (azwj): “<a href=\"/#/books/quran:57#h17\"><a href=\"/books/quran:57#h17\">[57:17]</a></a> Know that Allah gives life to the earth after its death”. He (a.s.) said: ‘The justice, after the oppression’."
        ]
      }
